  "description": "<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Brand Introduction:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><em>See It, Live It is a lifestyle brand built around one belief: the clearer your vision, the faster you can achieve it. Our mission is to help people visualise their dream life so clearly, they start living it &mdash; through storytelling, mindset tools, and powerful visualisation experiences.</em></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><strong>Product Description:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><span class=\"s1\">Your Vision Book</span> is a fully personalised hardcover book that tells the story of your future life &mdash; written like it&rsquo;s already happened. After answering 12 guided questions, each customer receives a cinematic, motivational story based on their dream lifestyle, goals, and habits. It&rsquo;s designed to be read over and over again &mdash; to build belief, clarity, and momentum.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><strong><span class=\"s2\"></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Fully customised based on each buyer&rsquo;s personal goals, routines &amp; vision</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Delivered in 24 hours &mdash; fast, premium, and deeply personal</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Feels like a movie script of your dream life</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Powerful for manifestation, motivation, and clarity</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Makes an inspiring gift or self-investment tool</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Optional audiobook version available with cinematic narration</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Bank Transfer&nbsp;</span></p>",
